  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint universal; <strong>CL</strong> 1st<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> see text; <strong>Price</strong> 500 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> -<br>\n<strong>DESCRIPTION</strong></p>\n<p>These tiny charms carry enchantments which are minor at best, and are often made by apprentice spellcasters looking to practice imbuing items with magic. When hung on a bracelet of charms or a necklace of many charms, the spark of power within them helps the user focus on what they do slightly better than they once could. All stack with one another, and with all other sources of bonuses to these class features. If you do not possess the class feature to be enhanced, that charm does nothing for you.</p>\n<p>Charm of Titles: Expand the maximum range of your titles by 10ft.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, creator must posses the class feature being refined <strong>Cost</strong> 250 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-wondrous-items#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
